{"unit_id":"NaivG__dsh-network#card-zh","repo":"NaivG/dsh-network","commit":"9203408ab989810134153dd96eda8c882e19b9fd","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@naivg/dsh-network 是面向 DeepSeek Harness Web 客户端的网络插件：它接入 DSH 的 web 搜索与抓取提供器，并注册网页搜索、页面抓取、HTTP 请求、站点地图查询和配置工具。搜索可在多个引擎间选择或按默认链回退；抓取可把网页内容整理为 Markdown，HTTP 请求支持自定义方法、请求头和正文。它还提供侧边栏搜索面板与网络设置界面，适合需要在 DSH 会话中查找当前资料、读取网页或调用 HTTP API 的用户。默认搜索链使用 Bing、DuckDuckGo 和百度。","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:77-152","dsh/tools.js:20-80","dsh/client.searchpanel.js:1-20"]}
{"unit_id":"NaivG__dsh-network#card-en","repo":"NaivG/dsh-network","commit":"9203408ab989810134153dd96eda8c882e19b9fd","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@naivg/dsh-network adds web search, Markdown page fetching, HTTP requests, and sitemap lookup tools to DSH. It includes a sidebar search panel and settings UI. Choose an engine or use the default Bing, DuckDuckGo, and Baidu chain to find current information and read pages in DSH.","source":"generated","evidence":["dsh/index.js:77-152","dsh/tools.js:20-80","dsh/client.searchpanel.js:1-20"]}
